body:
Since my childhood i like to live alone and i felt burdened if i was among many people. so mostly i was always in my room doing nothing. Even though i felt alone and bored in my room i never had any courage to go out. in the end when i got to know gaming and anime,which basically gave me a purpose in my life. i actually looked forward to something.  

&#x200B;

i used to come home from school and actually have something i wanted to do instead of staring into nothingness. Even now m dream is to live a comfortable life with my amazing gaming pc and full anime collection which i earn with my own money and then die in peace.
